Resort\nPROVIDING DAKOTA DUNES, SD WITH QUALITY AND COMPASSIONATE VETERINARY CARE SINCE 2006\nDunes Animal Hospital is a full-service animal hospital and will take both emergency cases as well as preventative medical, surgical, and dental issues. Our veterinarians are experienced in all types of conditions and treatments. Beyond first-rate pet care, we make our clinic comfortable, kid-friendly, and a very calm environment so your pet can relax in the waiting room and look forward to meeting his or her veterinarian.\nEmergency Care\nWellness Care\nSurgery\nDentistry\nBoarding\nEmergency Care\nWellness Care\nSurgery\nDentistry\nBoarding\nEmergency Care\nWellness Care\nSurgery\nDentistry\nBoarding\nEmergency Care\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(605) 242-5412\nText:\n(605) 356-8525\nFax:\n(605) 242-5415\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nTue\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nWed\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nThu\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nFri\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nSat\n8:00am\n-\n12:00pm\nSun\nClosed\nEmergency service available after hours. If you have an emergency, please give us a call to best accommodate your needs\nDedicated to Companion Animals and Those Who Care for Them\nOur doctors in the Dakota Dunes and Siouxland area are licensed veterinarians, treating all types of pets and animals.  Your pet's health and well-being are very important to us and we will take every step to give your pet the best possible care.\nAbout Us\nClient Reviews & Testimonials\nWe have cared for hundreds of happy and healthy South Dakota pets since 2006. Here's what your neighbors have to say about us.\nDunes Animal Hospital\n387 W Steamboat Dr\nDakota Dunes\n,\nSD\n57049\nT:\n(605) 242-5412\nF:\n(605) 242-5415\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nTue\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nWed\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nThu\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nFri\n7:30am\n-\n5:30pm\nSat\n8:00am\n-\n12:00pm\nSun\nClosed\nEmergency service available after hours. If you have an emergency, please give us a call to best accommod